<!-- Anomaly engine findings (P9), added 2026-11-23.
     Source: /home/agent/agents/anomaly-engine/findings.jsonl on the agent box (agent claude_agents), one JSON object per line
     {"anomaly_engine": {detector, severity, attack, entity, summary, evidence, event_time, mode}}.
     Levels are per detector; the engine writes nothing here during the burn-in (until 2026-12-07). -->
